ion (By similarity). Negatively regulates cell cycle G2/M phase transition probably by transactivating p21/CDKN1A through the p53/TP53-independent signaling pathway (By similarity). Involved in kidney proximal tubule morphogenesis (By similarity). Down-regulates activation of NF-kappa-B (PubMed:15799966)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}